flowchart LR
    Client[Clients] --> Edge[Proposed API gateway<br/>auth, quotas, request limits]
    Edge --> Ingest[Proposed command ingress<br/>idempotency + durable acceptance]
    Ingest --> Log[(Proposed partitioned event log<br/>128 partitions initially)]
    Log --> Workers[Proposed Settlement workers<br/>ordered by assignor/Receivable key]
    Workers --> Shards[(Proposed PostgreSQL shards<br/>strong consistency per partition)]
    Workers --> Outbox[(Transactional outbox)]
    Outbox --> Projection[Idempotent statement projectors]
    Projection --> Read[(Partitioned statement read model)]
    Rates[(Versioned rate store)] --> Cache[Immutable-key rate cache]
    Cache --> Workers
    Log --> DLQ[Quarantine + replay tooling]
    Shards --> Reconcile[Independent reconciliation]
    Read --> Query[Statement query API]

    subgraph Current[Implemented exercise boundary]
        Monolith[Modular monolith]
        Database[(Single PostgreSQL)]
        Monolith --> Database
    end
